{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0494_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c2ffedf592252a98274eb3213034727c02788cf965ceba2710196e42cf007266", "ja": "（魔法世界を舞台としたドラマ、その続編の撮影が\n進行中だ。確認したい事があるんだけど、風花は……）", "zh": "（以魔法世界为舞台的电视剧，续篇的拍摄正在进行中。有件事想确认一下，不过风花她……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0494_1001_041fuk", "source_sha256": "1ebdc7efc63327ebdfe4ede2f5e0d94b4b2d72b5869b62072e22ae65a70cfb67", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん。\nここにいたんですね。ちょっと探しちゃいました。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生。\n原来你在这里啊。我刚才还找了你好一会儿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0494_1002_p", "source_sha256": "4d8fa635d3fea9e40e1dd10710cf734acfa568643436d9414b4ef6cdc6e172ff", "ja": "あっ、風花。\n良かった、こっちも探してたんだ。", "zh": "啊，风花。\n太好了，我也正找你呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0494_1003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "b5cd35e13f85466c0efce38438b4e30c59c3d548600f087c72e0cf05d9777e26", "ja": "ふふっ、こんな偶然もあるんですね！　それで\n{$P$}さん、何のご用ですか？", "zh": "呵呵，居然会有这么巧的事！那么，{$P$}先生，找我有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0494_1004_p", "source_sha256": "fc73b59c97c70f0a345d751418232a35e1e5daebd32ad754eeb49027b3f120b7", "ja": "いや、風花こそ何の用事だったんだ？\nそっちから先でいいよ。", "zh": "不，风花你找我又是有什么事？\n你先说吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0494_1005_041fuk", "source_sha256": "c8a3dbe10619403b763ac7105ac1a9ca317dc5a1621cb85699a92e24c5452e14", "ja": "え？　でも{$P$}さんのお話のほうが\n大事なことかもしれませんし……。", "zh": "诶？可是，{$P$}先生要说的事情，说不定更重要……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0494_1006_p", "source_sha256": "7f8765610afdf62cf0e52e4da167635abff63edf5b2f0aa629ea270ccf0e7996", "ja": "それを言うなら風花だってわざわざ探してたんだろう？\n先にアイドルの相談に乗らないと……。", "zh": "要这么说的话，风花不也特意找过来了吗？还是先听听偶像们的烦恼吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0494_1007_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a45cb8b9d92f8850732e553b9b384bc355cbc86439f5057caf02fa57196e3d7c", "ja": "でも……。", "zh": "可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0494_1008_p", "source_sha256": "68413581afa59b0883b6d7cd47f5bf1cbae85b417bb7d7c9ae8cb49078e693f3", "ja": "いや……。", "zh": "没事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0494_1009_041fuk", "source_sha256": "19c9764068f4e578ea5e085dbefa1612df810aba8df9e920f5011d1a6394d4c1", "ja": "ふふっ……ふふふっ。\nこのままだと、ずっと続いちゃいそうですね。", "zh": "呵呵……呵呵呵。\n这样下去，感觉会一直持续下去呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0494_1010_p", "source_sha256": "4e610d24596c86088d2178efb5118ff8aeb007e8d7e6e1b3556640f5c2214567", "ja": "そうだな……相手に気を遣ってばかりでも、\n先に進まないな。", "zh": "是啊……总是一味顾虑对方的话，也没法继续前进。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0494_1011_041fuk", "source_sha256": "0346924ad31b922da52e29cc1f687b38d75a847d98d7ce0e1497c9c64ef44d0a", "ja": "ちょうど、そのことで悩んでいたんです。\nでも、なんだかわかった気がします。", "zh": "我正为这件事烦恼呢。不过，好像有点明白了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0494_1012_p", "source_sha256": "bd97e95081f7f36b09c8ef87856c979760b323ceef3545969afe598dcc62cd46", "ja": "その事？", "zh": "那件事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0494_1013_041fuk", "source_sha256": "eaccef7a0971e3b0da9ad06d00842bc09f18bfca75689858c4a4dbeed966c8aa", "ja": "ええ。魔法学園の、私と歌織さんの役……\n風花と歌織のことなんですけど。", "zh": "嗯。是关于魔法学院里，我和歌织小姐所饰演的角色……\n也就是风花和歌织的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0494_1014_041fuk", "source_sha256": "82d578e7d6f394f5f5f6c3d0a7067654f7cb11c812d8c3fc0e6a5c8959f6fe63", "ja": "あのふたりも、パートナーではあっても、\nお互いどこか遠慮があって……。", "zh": "她们两人就算是搭档，彼此之间也还是有些拘谨……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0494_1015_041fuk", "source_sha256": "f5ae2f0633479ee32e632ba7d8751101d06bea040a8442208630ed19378fd207", "ja": "ならどうすれば距離が縮まるのかなって、\nいろいろ考えてしまったんです。", "zh": "所以我就一直在想，要怎样才能拉近彼此的距离呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0494_1016_p", "source_sha256": "ce410688d9d0fa34817a9e0576fa73d9707814ac5ccf6b57ff34ac2b6e98d508", "ja": "なるほど……\nそれで、解決方法が見つかったのか？", "zh": "原来如此……\n那么，你找到解决办法了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0494_1017_041fuk", "source_sha256": "aeda0d60fbcc52df234407071231461659d4466a8e5ba5fc7a4cfd23d7a0329d", "ja": "ええ。思いきって、ぶつかるしかないのかなって。\n相手に気を遣ってばかりじゃ、何も進まないですから。", "zh": "嗯。我在想，或许只能鼓起勇气正面面对了。一直顾虑对方的话，什么都无法推进。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0494_1018_p", "source_sha256": "caf6c26ea99761b6fcf87ceee19c4655a169884855599a91d235120569ad2d69", "ja": "はは、そうだな。これからもずっと付き合っていく、\n大切な相手なら、尚更だ。", "zh": "哈哈，说得对。既然是今后也要一直相处的重要对象，那就更应该这样了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0494_1019_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ea4e3fecfc9ea690711ef605c57cd160017a298a2c127b0a802663737b97a50f", "ja": "はい！　……というわけで、私は話せたので。\n次は、{$P$}さんの番ですよ？", "zh": "是！……所以，我已经说完了。\n接下来轮到{$P$}先生了哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0494_1020_p", "source_sha256": "fa809c85ef8260b136d87a04dcc0580c01d11eb7d081f4fa1fa7649a70e5bdd9", "ja": "そうだな、じゃあ……あれ？\n何の用事だったっけ……。", "zh": "是啊，那就……咦？\n我本来是要办什么事来着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0494_1021_041fuk", "source_sha256": "e02c4e3498be7b5cb8d047e843bcf68f115ec065ea24d50833116f29bdb6cd7d", "ja": "え？\n……もしかして、忘れちゃったんですか？", "zh": "咦？\n……难道说，你忘了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0494_1022_p", "source_sha256": "0cf353e1d9302384b4a8567929d115c05e2b154b3676958e050f28809278ff54", "ja": "ご、ごめん。でも忘れるって事は、\nそんなに大した内容じゃなかったのかも……。", "zh": "对、对不起。不过既然会忘记，可能也不是什么特别重要的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0494_1023_041fuk", "source_sha256": "91e9768d5aff5ba4124a9b4eae85731081ae484d1371c49c497bacc350719d35", "ja": "じゃあ、思い出したら、いつでも言ってくださいね？\n遠慮なく。", "zh": "那么，要是想起来了，随时告诉我哦？\n不用客气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_041fuk0494_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_041fuk0494_1024_p", "source_sha256": "6ec43d172380dbdedc656f33c8d0fdc274100971a575ad61551fd1d9e15c82df", "ja": "そうさせてもらうよ。……これからも付き合っていく、\n大切な相手なのは、こっちも同じだからな！", "zh": "那我就不客气了。……毕竟今后也会一直相处下去，是对我来说同样重要的人啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
